      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AMRON SAMMY (2) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten 0.7 lengths over 460m this track in 26.21. Likely to feature again. PAW BRUTUS (7) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (25.51) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Geelong. Can improve sharply here. I'M EASY (1) turned in a better effort at Healesville last start, finishing third behind Snow Road (19.73) in a Grade 5. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from eight starts. Expected to feature. DOONGALLA DON (8) was a surprise last-start placegetter with solid claims again.",
